<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Detailed Hyper-parameters</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We detail the hyperparameters used for GRPO training and the GradAlign selection process in Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix A Detailed Hyper-parameters ‣ GradAlign: Gradient-Aligned Data Selection forLLM Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>. For all experiments, we utilize the AdamW optimizer with a learning rate of <math id="A1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-6}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
